rectangle "ProjectForge | Separate system boundary" {
 usecase "Refine an item into tasks\nUC-D07-REFINE" as refine [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d07-refine]]
 usecase "Maintain a Sprint Backlog\nUC-D07-PLAN" as plan [[../04-scenarios-and-models/user-stories-and-scenarios.md#uc-d07-plan]]
