}
participant -- refine
participant -- plan
participant -- end
legend bottom
Sources: PKS-D03-D05 / D07-D09 / D11.
A Sprint Backlog combines goal, selected items and delivery plan.
Task completion, item acceptance and Sprint outcome retain separate meanings.
Associations show proposed external interactions, not permission grants.
No include/extend dependency or actor inheritance is asserted.
